config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_MILIGHT_ESP8266
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Milight ESP8266 hub"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	default n
	help
		control of the groups and lamps driven by the ESP8266 gateway for Milight/AppLamp, over MQTT (it speaks to the ESP8266 gateway with its own MQTT client, so the native RF driver of Domoticz is not involved).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/espmilighthub-domoticz, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> espmilighthub, enter the address of the ESP8266 gateway.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
